{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07524","headline":"谢陆处士杼山折青桂花见寄之什 · 颜真卿","name":"谢陆处士杼山折青桂花见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣子游杼山，山寒桂花白。\n绿荑含素蕚，采折自逋客。\n忽枉岩中诗，芳香润金石。\n全高南越蠹，岂谢东堂策。\n会惬名山期，从君恣幽觌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07524.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07524","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}